# Formatter ownership contract: Biome owns the TS family (see biome.json);
# a repo-wide Prettier run must never cross that boundary, nor touch
# lockfiles, vendored agent tooling, husky's generated shims, or file types
# outside Prettier's scope here (markdown/yaml/shell/Dockerfile). Ignore
# files are excluded too: prettier-plugin-sh only supports them best-effort
# (negation patterns can be mangled). tests/src is a tracked symlink to
# ../src — a build context, not source; ignoring it guards against
# explicit-path runs formatting through the link.
*.ts
*.tsx
*.js
*.jsx
*.json
*.jsonc

.gitignore
.dockerignore
bun.lock
skills-lock.json
.agents/
.zcode/
.worktrees/
tests/src

.husky/_
